{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-inference-accelerator","title":"AI 推理加速器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications/ai-inference-accelerator","wordCount":2005,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-推理加速器\">AI 推理加速器</h1><p>FPGA 正在成为 AI 推理加速的重要平台，尤其在边缘计算、低延迟推理和可定制化部署场景中展现出独特优势。相比 GPU 的高吞吐批处理模式，FPGA 可以针对特定模型架构定制数据流，实现微秒级延迟的实时推理。本文介绍 FPGA AI 推理加速器的架构原理、量化部署方法和实际设计考量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>FPGA AI 加速器的设计核心是<strong>用数据流架构适配算法</strong>：GPU 靠通用算力与批处理取胜，FPGA 则把某个网络的数据复用模式固化成硬件流水线，从而换取极低的延迟和确定的响应时间。这意味着设计重心不在&quot;堆多少算力&quot;，而在&quot;如何让数据少搬运&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>平台定位</strong>：低延迟、确定性、可重配置的场景选 FPGA；最高吞吐选 GPU；最低功耗、固定模型量产选 ASIC。</li>\n<li><strong>数据流是灵魂</strong>：输出固定/权重固定/行固定/输入固定四种模式决定谁被复用、谁被反复搬运，直接影响能效。</li>\n<li><strong>PE 阵列决定算力上限</strong>：算力 ≈ PE 数 × 每周期 MAC 数 × 频率，INT8 可在单个 DSP48 内打包 2 次 MAC。</li>\n<li><strong>量化是前提</strong>：FP32 → INT8 可带来 4 倍算力与存储压缩，是 FPGA/ASIC 推理的主流精度选择。</li>\n<li><strong>存储带宽常是第一瓶颈</strong>：用 Roofline 模型判断层是计算受限还是带宽受限，再决定分块、融合或复用策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"fpga-在-ai-推理中的定位\">FPGA 在 AI 推理中的定位</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph AI推理部署平台选择&#10;        REQ{&quot;部署需求&quot;}&#10;        REQ --&gt;|&quot;最高吞吐&lt;br/&gt;批量处理&lt;br/&gt;灵活模型&quot;| GPU[&quot;GPU&lt;br/&gt;NVIDIA A100/H100&quot;]&#10;        REQ --&gt;|&quot;低延迟&lt;br/&gt;确定性&lt;br/&gt;可定制&quot;| FPGA[&quot;FPGA&lt;br/&gt;AMD Versal/Alveo&quot;]&#10;        REQ --&gt;|&quot;最低功耗&lt;br/&gt;固定模型&lt;br/&gt;最大量产&quot;| ASIC[&quot;ASIC&lt;br/&gt;Google TPU/专用芯片&quot;]&#10;        REQ --&gt;|&quot;通用推理&lt;br/&gt;成本敏感&lt;br/&gt;软件生态&quot;| CPU[&quot;CPU + NPU&lt;br/&gt;Intel/ARM&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph AI推理部署平台选择\n        REQ{\"部署需求\"}\n        REQ --&gt;|\"最高吞吐&lt;br/&gt;批量处理&lt;br/&gt;灵活模型\"| GPU[\"GPU&lt;br/&gt;NVIDIA A100/H100\"]\n        REQ --&gt;|\"低延迟&lt;br/&gt;确定性&lt;br/&gt;可定制\"| FPGA[\"FPGA&lt;br/&gt;AMD Versal/Alveo\"]\n        REQ --&gt;|\"最低功耗&lt;br/&gt;固定模型&lt;br/&gt;最大量产\"| ASIC[\"ASIC&lt;br/&gt;Google TPU/专用芯片\"]\n        REQ --&gt;|\"通用推理&lt;br/&gt;成本敏感&lt;br/&gt;软件生态\"| CPU[\"CPU + NPU&lt;br/&gt;Intel/ARM\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>GPU</th>\n<th>FPGA</th>\n<th>ASIC</th>\n<th>CPU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推理延迟</td>\n<td>1-10 ms</td>\n<td>10-500 μs</td>\n<td>1-100 μs</td>\n<td>10-100 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批处理吞吐</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功耗效率 (TOPS/W)</td>\n<td>1-5</td>\n<td>3-20</td>\n<td>10-50</td>\n<td>0.5-2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>高（软件）</td>\n<td>高（可重配置）</td>\n<td>无（固化）</td>\n<td>高（软件）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发周期</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>长（12-24月）</td>\n<td>最短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型更新</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>分钟级重配置</td>\n<td>需新芯片</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"卷积神经网络-cnn-的-fpga-映射\">卷积神经网络（CNN）的 FPGA 映射</h2><h3 id=\"卷积运算的并行化\">卷积运算的并行化</h3><p>卷积是 CNN 中计算量最大的操作。一个标准卷积层的计算量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>W</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MACs = H_{out} \\times W_{out} \\times C_{out} \\times C_{in} \\times K_H \\times K_W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 ResNet-50 的某卷积层为例（输入 56×56×64，3×3 卷积，输出 64 通道）： </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>115</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MACs = 56 \\times 56 \\times 64 \\times 64 \\times 3 \\times 3 \\approx 115M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">115</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"数据流架构\">数据流架构</h3><p>FPGA CNN 加速器的主流数据流架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph CNN加速器架构&#10;        DDR[&quot;外部 DDR&lt;br/&gt;权重+激活值&quot;] --&gt; DMA[&quot;DMA 引擎&quot;]&#10;        DMA --&gt; BUF_W[&quot;权重缓冲&lt;br/&gt;BRAM/URAM&quot;]&#10;        DMA --&gt; BUF_A[&quot;激活值缓冲&lt;br/&gt;BRAM/URAM&quot;]&#10;        BUF_W --&gt; PE[&quot;PE 阵列&lt;br/&gt;DSP48 乘累加&quot;]&#10;        BUF_A --&gt; PE&#10;        PE --&gt; ACC[&quot;累加器&lt;br/&gt;部分和&quot;]&#10;        ACC --&gt; POST[&quot;后处理&lt;br/&gt;BN/ReLU/Pool&quot;]&#10;        POST --&gt; BUF_OUT[&quot;输出缓冲&quot;]&#10;        BUF_OUT --&gt; DMA&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph CNN加速器架构\n        DDR[\"外部 DDR&lt;br/&gt;权重+激活值\"] --&gt; DMA[\"DMA 引擎\"]\n        DMA --&gt; BUF_W[\"权重缓冲&lt;br/&gt;BRAM/URAM\"]\n        DMA --&gt; BUF_A[\"激活值缓冲&lt;br/&gt;BRAM/URAM\"]\n        BUF_W --&gt; PE[\"PE 阵列&lt;br/&gt;DSP48 乘累加\"]\n        BUF_A --&gt; PE\n        PE --&gt; ACC[\"累加器&lt;br/&gt;部分和\"]\n        ACC --&gt; POST[\"后处理&lt;br/&gt;BN/ReLU/Pool\"]\n        POST --&gt; BUF_OUT[\"输出缓冲\"]\n        BUF_OUT --&gt; DMA\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据流模式</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>代表工作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输出固定（Output Stationary）</td>\n<td>PE 保持输出部分和不动</td>\n<td>减少部分和搬运</td>\n<td>ShiDianNao</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重固定（Weight Stationary）</td>\n<td>PE 保持权重不动</td>\n<td>减少权重读取</td>\n<td>TPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行固定（Row Stationary）</td>\n<td>最大化数据复用</td>\n<td>最优能效</td>\n<td>Eyeriss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入固定（Input Stationary）</td>\n<td>PE 保持输入不动</td>\n<td>适合深度可分离卷积</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"pe-processing-element-阵列设计\">PE（Processing Element）阵列设计</h3><p>典型的 PE 阵列组织为二维脉动阵列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型配置</th>\n<th>设计依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PE 阵列大小</td>\n<td>16×16 / 32×32</td>\n<td>可用 DSP 数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每个 PE 精度</td>\n<td>INT8 MAC</td>\n<td>量化精度需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DSP48 复用</td>\n<td>2-4 个 INT8 MAC/DSP48</td>\n<td>DSP48 是 27×18 乘法器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时钟频率</td>\n<td>200-400 MHz</td>\n<td>时序收敛约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>峰值算力</td>\n<td>PE数 × 2 × 频率 TOPS</td>\n<td>INT8 可在 DSP48 中做 2 次 MAC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模型量化\">模型量化</h2><h3 id=\"量化原理\">量化原理</h3><p>将浮点（FP32）模型参数和激活值转换为低位宽定点数（INT8/INT4），以减少计算和存储需求：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{int} = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{x_{float}}{scale}\\right) + zero\\_point</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9695em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{float} = (x_{int} - zero\\_point) \\times scale</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"量化方案对比\">量化方案对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量化方式</th>\n<th>精度损失</th>\n<th>计算加速</th>\n<th>存储压缩</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FP32（基线）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>1×</td>\n<td>1×</td>\n<td>训练、高精度要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FP16</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>2×</td>\n<td>2×</td>\n<td>GPU 混合精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT8</td>\n<td>小（&lt; 1% Top-1）</td>\n<td>4×</td>\n<td>4×</td>\n<td>FPGA/ASIC 推理主流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT4</td>\n<td>中等（1-3%）</td>\n<td>8×</td>\n<td>8×</td>\n<td>极致效率场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二值/三值</td>\n<td>大（需要专用架构）</td>\n<td>16-32×</td>\n<td>32×</td>\n<td>研究阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"int8-在-dsp48-中的实现\">INT8 在 DSP48 中的实现</h3><p>一个 27×18-bit 的 DSP48E2 可以同时执行两个独立的 INT8 乘法（通过位打包技巧）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>打包方式</th>\n<th>单个 DSP48 吞吐</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单 INT8×INT8</td>\n<td>1 MAC/cycle</td>\n<td>最简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双 INT8×INT8</td>\n<td>2 MAC/cycle</td>\n<td>利用 27-bit 宽度打包两个 8-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT4×INT4（四路）</td>\n<td>4 MAC/cycle</td>\n<td>进一步打包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推理引擎架构\">推理引擎架构</h2><h3 id=\"分层执行模式\">分层执行模式</h3><p>完整的 CNN 推理引擎需要支持多种层类型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 推理引擎执行流程&#10;        CTRL[&quot;全局控制器&lt;br/&gt;层调度/DMA管理&quot;] --&gt; CONV[&quot;卷积引擎&lt;br/&gt;PE 阵列&quot;]&#10;        CTRL --&gt; POOL[&quot;池化引擎&lt;br/&gt;Max/Avg&quot;]&#10;        CTRL --&gt; EW[&quot;逐元素运算&lt;br/&gt;Add/Mul/ReLU&quot;]&#10;        CTRL --&gt; FC[&quot;全连接层&lt;br/&gt;矩阵乘法&quot;]&#10;        CONV --&gt; OUT_BUF[&quot;输出缓冲&quot;]&#10;        POOL --&gt; OUT_BUF&#10;        EW --&gt; OUT_BUF&#10;        FC --&gt; OUT_BUF&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 推理引擎执行流程\n        CTRL[\"全局控制器&lt;br/&gt;层调度/DMA管理\"] --&gt; CONV[\"卷积引擎&lt;br/&gt;PE 阵列\"]\n        CTRL --&gt; POOL[\"池化引擎&lt;br/&gt;Max/Avg\"]\n        CTRL --&gt; EW[\"逐元素运算&lt;br/&gt;Add/Mul/ReLU\"]\n        CTRL --&gt; FC[\"全连接层&lt;br/&gt;矩阵乘法\"]\n        CONV --&gt; OUT_BUF[\"输出缓冲\"]\n        POOL --&gt; OUT_BUF\n        EW --&gt; OUT_BUF\n        FC --&gt; OUT_BUF\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"片上存储策略\">片上存储策略</h3><p>存储带宽通常是 FPGA AI 加速器的第一瓶颈。优化策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分块（Tiling）</td>\n<td>将大特征图切分为片上可容纳的小块</td>\n<td>减少片外访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层融合（Fusion）</td>\n<td>连续层（Conv+BN+ReLU）合并执行</td>\n<td>消除中间结果写出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重复用</td>\n<td>同一权重用于多个输出位置</td>\n<td>减少权重带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激活值复用</td>\n<td>滑窗重叠区域的数据复用</td>\n<td>减少输入带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双缓冲</td>\n<td>计算与数据搬运重叠</td>\n<td>隐藏 DDR 延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"性能模型\">性能模型</h3><p>推理引擎的实际性能受限于计算能力和存储带宽中的瓶颈（Roofline 模型）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Performance</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>Peak TOPS</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>BW</mtext><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>OI</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Performance} = \\min\\left(\\text{Peak TOPS}, \\quad \\text{BW}_{DDR} \\times \\text{OI}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Performance</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Peak TOPS</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BW</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OI</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 OI（Operational Intensity）= 计算量 / 数据搬运量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层类型</th>\n<th>典型 OI</th>\n<th>瓶颈</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1×1 卷积</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>计算受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3×3 卷积</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度可分离卷积</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>带宽受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全连接层</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>带宽受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>池化</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>带宽受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"开发工具链\">开发工具链</h2><h3 id=\"高层次综合-hls-流程\">高层次综合（HLS）流程</h3><p>现代 FPGA AI 开发越来越多地采用 HLS（如 Vitis HLС）和编译器驱动的方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>厂商</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Vitis AI</td>\n<td>AMD/Xilinx</td>\n<td>TensorFlow/PyTorch 模型</td>\n<td>DPU 指令流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenVINO + FPGA Plugin</td>\n<td>Intel</td>\n<td>ONNX/IR 模型</td>\n<td>GNA/FPGA 配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FINN</td>\n<td>AMD 研究</td>\n<td>量化 ONNX 模型</td>\n<td>定制数据流架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hls4ml</td>\n<td>学术</td>\n<td>Keras/PyTorch 模型</td>\n<td>HLS C++ → RTL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"典型部署流程\">典型部署流程</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>模型训练</strong>：PyTorch/TensorFlow 训练浮点模型</li>\n<li><strong>量化</strong>：训练后量化（PTQ）或量化感知训练（QAT）→ INT8 模型</li>\n<li><strong>编译</strong>：编译器将量化模型映射到 FPGA 加速器的指令集</li>\n<li><strong>部署</strong>：加载比特流（加速器硬件）+ 指令流（模型参数和调度）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年趋势\">2026 年趋势</h2><p>截至 2026 年，FPGA AI 推理加速的主要发展方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>趋势</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>代表技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异构集成</td>\n<td>FPGA + AI 专用引擎 + CPU 一体化</td>\n<td>AMD Versal AI Edge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀疏加速</td>\n<td>利用权重/激活值稀疏性跳过零值计算</td>\n<td>结构化稀疏 2:4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transformer 加速</td>\n<td>注意力机制的硬件优化</td>\n<td>FlashAttention FPGA 版</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大模型推理</td>\n<td>通过 Chiplet 和 HBM 扩展容量</td>\n<td>AMD Alveo V80</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端侧部署</td>\n<td>超低功耗 FPGA 边缘推理</td>\n<td>AMD Kria SOM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>FPGA AI 推理加速器代表了&quot;用硬件架构适配算法&quot;的思路，与 GPU&quot;用通用计算力暴力解决&quot;形成互补。在对延迟、功耗和确定性有严格要求的场景中，FPGA 是目前最优的可编程解决方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>FPGA 在 AI 推理中的定位是低延迟、确定性、可重配置，与 GPU 的高吞吐批处理和 ASIC 的低功耗量产形成互补。</li>\n<li>CNN 映射的关键是卷积并行化与数据流选择：输出固定、权重固定、行固定、输入固定分别对应不同的数据复用策略。</li>\n<li>PE 阵列以二维脉动结构组织，规模取决于可用 DSP 数量，INT8 下单个 DSP48 可打包 2 次 MAC。</li>\n<li>模型量化把 FP32 转为 INT8/INT4，在可控精度损失下获得数倍算力与存储压缩，是 FPGA 推理的主流选择。</li>\n<li>推理引擎需支持卷积、池化、逐元素运算和全连接等多类层的调度，片上存储策略（分块/融合/复用/双缓冲）决定带宽效率。</li>\n<li>Roofline 模型用于判断每一层是计算受限还是带宽受限，指导优化方向。</li>\n<li>开发工具链（Vitis AI、OpenVINO、FINN、hls4ml）和高层次综合降低了部署门槛，典型流程是训练 → 量化 → 编译 → 部署。</li>\n<li>2026 年趋势包括异构集成、稀疏加速、Transformer 硬件优化、大模型推理与端侧部署。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI 推理加速器","id":"ai-推理加速器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"FPGA 在 AI 推理中的定位","id":"fpga-在-ai-推理中的定位"},{"level":2,"text":"卷积神经网络（CNN）的 FPGA 映射","id":"卷积神经网络-cnn-的-fpga-映射"},{"level":3,"text":"卷积运算的并行化","id":"卷积运算的并行化"},{"level":3,"text":"数据流架构","id":"数据流架构"},{"level":3,"text":"PE（Processing Element）阵列设计","id":"pe-processing-element-阵列设计"},{"level":2,"text":"模型量化","id":"模型量化"},{"level":3,"text":"量化原理","id":"量化原理"},{"level":3,"text":"量化方案对比","id":"量化方案对比"},{"level":3,"text":"INT8 在 DSP48 中的实现","id":"int8-在-dsp48-中的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"推理引擎架构","id":"推理引擎架构"},{"level":3,"text":"分层执行模式","id":"分层执行模式"},{"level":3,"text":"片上存储策略","id":"片上存储策略"},{"level":3,"text":"性能模型","id":"性能模型"},{"level":2,"text":"开发工具链","id":"开发工具链"},{"level":3,"text":"高层次综合（HLS）流程","id":"高层次综合-hls-流程"},{"level":3,"text":"典型部署流程","id":"典型部署流程"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年趋势","id":"2026-年趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"通信协议实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/fpga-applications/communication-protocol-implementation"},"next":null}